  m_text: When the elevator arrives at the nearest floor, the doors open for a certain
    period. After the passengers exit, the doors will close and the elevator will
    remain on standby. If the earthquake is approximately seismic intensity 4 or
    lower, the elevator will automatically resume operation after a certain period.
    If the earthquake is stronger than seismic intensity 4, the elevator will not
    resume automatically and will only return to service after a safety inspection
    by authorized personnel.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
