  m_text: 'During Flood Emergency Operation, the elevator stops at the nearest floor
    and the doors open. If the nearest floor is the lowest floor (1st floor), the
    doors open after moving to the floor above.

    In the event of flooding, the
    lower levels of the building may be flooded, so do not evacuate to the lower
    floors and follow the instructions of the staff.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e8141f4f9a3a607409cb6edc4beab281, type: 2}
